LanguageData.ShiftChange.AlertServesNothingDesc:
These stands are set to serve something, but dress nobody:
{0}

In the open, a stand's room is all the open ground on the map, so give it a radius or an allowed area under Serves in its settings. Where its allowed area is gone, choose what it serves again under Serves. Where it stands outside its area, paint the area over the stand, or move the stand into it.
